# Mediación Virtual Dark Mode (Android WebView Client)

wrapper ligero hecho por mi para Mediación Virtual de la UCR.

Designed to eliminate blinding white UI flashes, fix awkward camera cutout overlaps, and style stubborn Moodle/Bootstrap components (`.main-inner`, `moremenu`, submission tables, and activity headers) into a clean, modern dark theme.

## ✨ Features
- **Zero-Flash Dark Loading:** Uses a native dark loading overlay and a micro-delay rendering engine to prevent the default white flash when switching pages.
- **Edge-to-Edge Display:** Dynamically adjusts window insets to clear punch-hole cameras and system status bars seamlessly.
- **Comprehensive CSS Injection:** Automatically injects scoped dark styles on page load to cover navbars, assignment boxes, restriction warnings, and course tables.
- **Modern Android APIs:** Implements modern `OnBackPressedDispatcher` navigation and edge-to-edge window drawing.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- **Language:** Java
- **UI:** XML Layouts (`FrameLayout`, `WebView`)
- **Architecture:** Native Android WebView Client with DOM CSS Injection
